  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w17.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w17.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝から、街が酒くさい。謝酒祭——酒へ感謝する祭りだそうだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "噴水から、うっすら発泡した何かが出ている。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "よりによって、その週に、査定官が来た。白い手袋、値札の束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「資産価値査定を開始。通常業務をお続けください」……今週は、祭りなんですが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "七世界の酒が、広場に並ぶ。竜の火酒——注ぐと燃えるのが、正解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "幽霊の気化酒は、飲まずに浴びる。海の塩酒は、つまみが要らない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "乾杯の作法だけで、回覧板が三枚も出ている。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "査定官は職務に忠実だった。目に映る全部に、値札を付けていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの備品に、高値。特訓場の壁の亀裂に、マイナス。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の監督指示には「声掛け:〇円」耳が、ちょっと下がった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.004d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.004d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "紙に値段を書かれると、地味に傷つく。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "事件は、火酒の屋台で起きた。竜のお客様が、査定官に一杯すすめた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「感謝の杯を断るのは、この祭りでは決闘の申し込みじゃぞ」査定官は、職務の顔のまま飲んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……飲んでしまった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ぽつり「……いい職場ですね、ここ」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "本音は、気化酒みたいに漏れるものらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "査定官は希望欄の束を(酔った勢いで)最後まで読み、目元を押さえた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「こういう帳簿は、査定項目に、無いんですよ」無いなら、作ってください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.007d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.007d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二度目の、お願いだった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.direction.mimi.shift.008",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w17.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "翌朝、酔いの醒めた査定官は、完璧な職務顔に戻っていた。結論欄に判を押して、帰っていった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「当チームは、資産としての管理を推奨する」祭りの夜の本音と、朝の判は、別の生き物らしい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「推奨は、命令の一歩手前の言葉です。次は、たぶん、案が来ます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "後片付けの音の中、その一言だけ、温度が低かった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その夜、控室の値札を、全部はがして回った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "人と道具の値段は、付けるのも外すのも、うちで決める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w17.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ただ一枚「プライスレス」の札だけ、屋台のおやじが記念に持ち帰った。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w17.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
